variations.statement:
Place le nombre ${{eval:(10*n+k)/10;d}}$ sur la demi-droite graduée.

```line
start: {{n}}
end: {{eval:(10*n+15)/10;d}}
step: 0.1
major: 10
placer: {{eval:(10*n+k)/10;d}}
```

Place le nombre ${{eval:(100*a+10*b+k)/100;d}}$ sur la demi-droite graduée.

```line
start: {{eval:(10*a+b)/10;d}}
end: {{eval:(100*a+10*b+15)/100;d}}
step: 0.01
major: 10
labels: {{eval:(10*a+b)/10;d}}, {{eval:(10*a+b+1)/10;d}}
placer: {{eval:(100*a+10*b+k)/100;d}}
```

Place le nombre ${{eval:k/q;d}}$ sur la demi-droite graduée.

```line
start: 0
end: 4
step: {{eval:1/q;d}}
major: {{q}}
placer: {{eval:k/q;d}}
```

Place les points $A({{eval:(10*n+k)/10;d}})$ et $B({{eval:(10*n+m)/10;d}})$ sur la demi-droite graduée.

```line
start: {{n}}
end: {{eval:(10*n+15)/10;d}}
step: 0.1
major: 10
placer: A={{eval:(10*n+k)/10;d}} ; B={{eval:(10*n+m)/10;d}}
```
